flux-tools (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Image Builder, Store, Help and Drive Utility to the default launcher,
    and keep Kernel Manager alongside Module Manager.
  * Match MiniOS application icons to their desktop entries and remove the
    legacy launcher migration.
  * Use pkexec for installation and applications that require root. Switch
    VLC and Chromium to guest only when launched from a root session.
  * Refresh application MIME caches without recreating deleted launchers or
    changing the user's preferred applications.
  * Stop on installation or authorization errors, and remove duplicate
    launchers only after a successful installation.
  * Use private temporary files for the menu and installation results, and
    remove them after success, failure or cancellation.
  * Update translations and manual pages.

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:55:19 +0300

